  "description": "Eun-jin catches her boyfriend, now ex, Jin-ho, cheating and that his lover turns out to be a transvestite?!\n\nJae-hee, who wants to become a woman, is enveloped in unknown emotions after meeting his \"\"friend\"\" Jin-ho's ex-girlfriend, Eun-jin.\n\nAround Eunjin, other characters with a crush on her are coming closer and closer...!\n\nA sexy and bizarre story between men as beautiful as flowers!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746008800), [Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/flower_5), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_aflower_wz), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/3004)  \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746012685), [Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/flower_her), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/54750253), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_aflower15_wz), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=sip1)",
